            "review_title": "Review at Banh Canh Ben Co",
            "review_text": "Rob Nesbit\nWarsaw, Poland6958 contributions\n0\nNice and tasty.\nMay 2022\nVietnamese friend suggested this place, for a quick bite to eat. To be honest wasn't sure, as its a fish and sea food joint....and I am not so much into these kinds of dishes.....but I was pleasantly surprised as I sat down to some prawn wrap, a few of them....dipped with the sauces and vinegar tasted fantastic,albeit they didn't look very appealing! Kind of look like a big fat condom, ha \nNice and tasty.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 19, 2022",
