            "review_title": "Review at Banh Canh Ben Co",
            "review_text": "394tamid\nMinneapolis8 contributions\n0\nDelish food!\nAug 2017 • Couples\nIf you're looking to try a variety of banh beos this is the place to go. We came and not long after we sat down on one of their plastic stools on the side walk, the lady likely recognized as tourists not knowing what to order and quickly placed down each of the dishes for us to try.\n\nWe actually just had breakfast but wanted to try banh beos before leaving the city and were left satisfied although we couldn't fit in the ones wrapped in banana leaves. The dishes are great for in between meals snacks or as apps before heading else where. \n\nNot the most friendly service nor the most comfortable ambience but would recommend it if you want to try different banhs.\nRead more\nWritten August 17, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
