            "review_text": "GourmetBaladeur\nHCMC175 contributions\n0\nExcellent banh canh & nem nuong at 112 Tran Hung Dao new address\nFeb 2016 • Friends\nThe 2 older premisces at Nguyen dinh Chieu and Nguyen Hue have been taken back by the owners. The new address is 112 Tran Hung Dao, near hotel Pullman.\nExcellent banh canh (big noodle with soup like udon) and nem nuong (grilled meat balls)....at very reasonable price.\nRecommended.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 16, 2016",
