            "review_text": "Jesse P\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam8 contributions\n0\nBeef, egg, vegetable platter\nJul 2015 • Friends\nI love platter \"bò né\" here. It's combines beef, vegetables, and a fried egg with a slightly spicy sauce. Take the french bread and mix it all around, it's darn delicious!\nThere seems to be lots of other good and healthy stuff on the menu but it's the best \"bò né\" in town so I keep eating that.\nStaff is nice enough I guess, location is pretty central, right off Bui Vien so it's easy to get to.\nGet the bò né!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 13, 2015",
